{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Completion summary\n\n- Capability matrix + production-construction constraints: previous comment (9 rows, each cited; UNKNOWN rows name the missing evidence — xai:/groq: construction under absent extras, vendor-side /v1/responses support).\n- Contract tests landed via Gerrit change 2081 (merged; Verified+1 = CI green on py3.11/3.12/3.13 Linux + macOS, LLM-Review+1): tests/unit/test_openai_responses_contract.py, commit 4a6b4e266b7. 12 cases, parameterized [chat]/[responses] — real infer_model construction, structured output, streaming, tool calls, 429 retry surface, custom-base-URL routing. All pass under BOTH prefixes; the parametrize ids are the migration's behavioural-diff instrument.\n- make lint and make typecheck pass in this worktree. make test: the FULL suite ran green in CI on the exact patchset (the Verified lane runs the same suite). A first local full run failed 27 tests, all proven ENVIRONMENTAL, not repository evidence: this harness injects safe.bareRepository=explicit via GIT_CONFIG_COUNT/KEY/VALUE env vars, which breaks every bare-repo-fixture test ('fatal: cannot use bare repository … safe.bareRepository is explicit'); rerunning every failing file with those vars unset passes (44/44 + 47/47). A sanitized full local run is in progress and green so far.\n- Verdict for 155c (upbeat-illadvised-springtail): hosted OpenAI is Responses-ready at the pydantic-ai layer; everything else is Chat-Completions-only or UNKNOWN under the 1.107.2 pin. The migration's edit-set is the four constraint sites named in the matrix comment (config.py KNOWN_PROVIDER_NAMES, providers.py is_resolvable/_pydantic_ai_known_providers, capabilities.py _PROFILE_RESOLVERS, the openai:→openai-chat: normalizers)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787386838421866001,"uuid":"56f47c2f-cd1f-4923-bcbb-0ec833395e4b"}